==Strategy==
Try to permafreeze Le'Grim using [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], by using the initial Doge Darks to gather a few Bombercats as well as meatshields. Once you kill the Doge Darks, Le'Grim will hit the meatshields, and your unsynced Bombercats will permafreeze Le'Grim. You can then continue to spam meatshields as well as units like Talented [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T]] as well as [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to rush down this stage and kill Le'Grim before Rain.D poses any serious threat.

